  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat the oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced. Chop cauliflower (including the stalk!) into small florets. Cut sweet potato into large chunks.\n• Place veggies on the lined oven tray. Sprinkle with BBQ spice blend, drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and toss to coat.\n• Roast until tender and brown around the edges, 20-25 mins.\n• Cut haloumi into 1cm slices. In a medium bowl, place haloumi and cover with water to soak.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/64793ec09d78942a83042688/step-acd46cf6.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, finely chop or crush garlic. In a medium saucepan, melt butter with a dash of olive oil over medium heat.\n• Cook Mexican seasoning, garlic and tomato paste until fragrant, 1-2 mins.\n• Add basmati rice, the water and a generous pinch of salt and bring to the boil. Reduce heat to low and cover with a lid.\n• Cook for 10 mins, then remove from heat and keep covered until rice is tender and the water absorbed, 10 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/64793ec09d78942a83042688/step-06b7ec1c.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, drain sweetcorn.\n• Heat frying pan over high heat. Add corn and cook until lightly browned, 4-5 mins. Transfer to a medium bowl.\n• Drain haloumi and pat dry. Return the frying pan to medium heat with a drizzle of oil. Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 mins each side.\n• Roughly chop tomato, then transfer to bowl with charred corn.\n• Drizzle with olive oil and white wine vinegar. Toss to coat and season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/64793ec09d78942a83042688/step-1f5e47b4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide garlic rice, haloumi and roast cauliflower between bowls.\n• Top with charred corn salsa and yoghurt.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/64793ec09d78942a83042688/step-38bd5799.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
